{"results": [{"name": "Myro", "entity_id": "87002213-B405-4D1C-A12D-13A82508F17E", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [], "description": "Myro is a sustainable personal care brand that reimagines daily hygiene products with a focus on refillable systems and plant-powered formulas. By replacing single-use plastics with reusable, aesthetically pleasing cases, the brand makes eco-friendly choices easy and stylish for the modern consumer. Operating primarily through a direct-to-consumer model, Myro appeals to environmentally conscious individuals who prioritize ingredient transparency and waste reduction. The brand sits at the intersection of lifestyle and beauty, positioning itself as a challenger in the traditional deodorant and body wash markets.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "itsmymyro"}}, "founded_year": "2018", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/87002213-B405-4D1C-A12D-13A82508F17E-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "Myro is a brand offering refillable, plant-powered body care products like deodorant and body wash focused on sustainability and reducing plastic waste.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "de", "value": "Eine pflanzliche Körperpflegemarke mit stilvollen, nachfüllbaren Produkten, die darauf ausgelegt sind, Einwegplastik aus der täglichen Pflegeroutine zu verbannen."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Une marque de soins corporels à base de plantes proposant des produits élégants et rechargeables, conçus pour éliminer les plastiques à usage unique des routines d'hygiène."}, {"language": "en", "value": "A plant-powered body care brand offering stylish, refillable products designed to eliminate single-use plastic waste from personal hygiene routines."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Una marca de cuidado corporal a base de plantas que ofrece productos elegantes y recargables, diseñados para eliminar el plástico de un solo uso en las rutinas de higiene personal."}]}, "popularity": 0.7271363428319574, "disambiguation": "", "